DexSwapModuleFactory_Fork
├── when the factory is deployed against the real Uniswap V3 router
│   ├── it should deploy successfully
│   └── it should reject an EOA router address
├── when create is called on a real chain
│   ├── it should wire the module to the real router
│   └── it should register the module in the factory
├── when createDeterministic is called on the fork
│   └── it should deploy to the predicted address
└── when a factory-deployed module is configured on a PaymentRails
    ├── it should swap real USDC for WETH through the real router
    ├── it should swap real WETH for USDC through the real router
    ├── it should clear the output against the real Chainlink oracle floor
    ├── it should leave no token balance or router approval on the module
    └── when two PaymentRails share the module
        └── it should swap for both instances
